      "message": "tests: tighten the shell-suite scorer and the sudo stub checks (#6)\n\nThe L1 scorer now follows a summary printed by a helper function through its call sites, so deleting the call is caught. Guarded exits, one-line case arms and redirected prints are read as conditionals. The sudo stub library checks the tc and ovs-vsctl it finds on PATH, and its mutation gate names the entry it removed in every failure.",
